Best Practices for Cluster Sets and Labels
Naming Conventions

Use consistent naming patterns for cluster sets
Apply meaningful labels that reflect organizational structure
Use hierarchical labeling (environment, region, team)
Policy Organization

Group related policies in dedicated namespaces
Use descriptive policy names and annotations
Implement proper RBAC for policy management
Monitoring and Maintenance

Regularly review cluster set memberships
Monitor policy compliance across all clusters
Update labels as organizational needs change
